00:25:06.330 --> 00:25:09.770
And 1-2-1-2-9-3-1-5-7-3-1,
my text platform,

00:25:09.770 --> 00:25:11.473
I see a lot of DM, I'm
just getting 10,000 a day.

00:25:11.473 --> 00:25:12.753
It's just, it's impossible.

00:25:12.753 --> 00:25:14.250
- [Jared] Right.

00:25:14.250 --> 00:25:15.390
- Thank you brother, have a great day.

00:25:15.390 --> 00:25:16.430
I'm glad you got through.

00:25:16.430 --> 00:25:17.390
Allen, where do you
think the league's going

00:25:17.390 --> 00:25:18.223
next five to 10 years?

00:25:18.223 --> 00:25:20.440
I set up this podcast
with your thoughtfulness.

00:25:20.440 --> 00:25:23.040
What's an interesting hot
take or random thought

00:25:23.040 --> 00:25:25.140
that you have that maybe others don't see?

00:25:26.168 --> 00:25:27.862
- Not anything too crazy.

00:25:27.862 --> 00:25:28.940
- Nothing too crazy?

00:25:28.940 --> 00:25:31.230
Can I give you a crazy
one before I let you go?

00:25:31.230 --> 00:25:33.690
I have this weird thought
that in 20 or 30 years,

00:25:33.690 --> 00:25:36.360
the NFL might play without helmets.

00:25:36.360 --> 00:25:37.221
- I can see that,

00:25:37.221 --> 00:25:39.210
I can see like the soft
helmets like on 7-on-7.

00:25:39.210 --> 00:25:40.300
- You know, it's interesting, I've been

00:25:40.300 --> 00:25:42.170
thinking a lot about like,
helmets are a problem

00:25:42.170 --> 00:25:44.820
because people don't
know their faces, right?

00:25:44.820 --> 00:25:45.803
NBA players, we hear a lot of,

00:25:45.803 --> 00:25:47.210
I've talked to a lot of football players

00:25:47.210 --> 00:25:48.356
like, "fucking helmets."

00:25:48.356 --> 00:25:50.660
You know this, you're wearing the AR,

00:25:50.660 --> 00:25:52.870
but this is real, a
lot of football players

00:25:52.870 --> 00:25:54.363
wear big ass chains with numbers on them

00:25:54.363 --> 00:25:56.380
because they know subconsciously,

00:25:56.380 --> 00:25:57.920
they know nobody knows who they are.

00:25:57.920 --> 00:25:59.660
And fuck, if you're a
fucking super star like that

00:25:59.660 --> 00:26:00.607
at that level, you want to.

00:26:00.607 --> 00:26:01.840
- [Allen] Yeah, for sure.

00:26:01.840 --> 00:26:04.091
- You know, and so, there's that.

00:26:04.091 --> 00:26:06.810
And the concussions, what would happen

00:26:06.810 --> 00:26:07.970
if big dudes like that.

00:26:07.970 --> 00:26:10.200
Like rugby, everyone's like
Gary they're too big and fast.

00:26:10.200 --> 00:26:11.331
I'm like, you watch rugby?

00:26:11.331 --> 00:26:12.743
Those rugby fuckers.

00:26:12.743 --> 00:26:13.576
- [Allen] Yeah they get after it.

00:26:13.576 --> 00:26:16.120
- They get after it in New
Zealand and South Africa

00:26:16.120 --> 00:26:17.600
and those places.

00:26:17.600 --> 00:26:20.330
Because they know they don't have helmets,

00:26:20.330 --> 00:26:21.900
they don't have as much shit go down.

00:26:21.900 --> 00:26:24.690
You have a helmet, you
fucking go in like a missile.

00:26:24.690 --> 00:26:27.550
I think my weird hot take
is 25 years from now,

00:26:27.550 --> 00:26:28.438
NFL no helmets.

00:26:28.438 --> 00:26:29.271
- I can see that.

00:26:29.271 --> 00:26:30.104
I can see that.

00:26:30.104 --> 00:26:32.590
I also think that the whole,
I think the fantasy football

00:26:32.590 --> 00:26:34.680
has helped out the
whole like facial thing.

00:26:34.680 --> 00:26:35.513
- [Gary] Yeah I agree.

00:26:35.513 --> 00:26:37.252
- I think that people playing fantasy.

00:26:37.252 --> 00:26:38.085
- You play fantasy?

00:26:38.085 --> 00:26:38.918
- [Allen] I do not play fantasy?

00:26:38.918 --> 00:26:39.751
