00:26:41.417 --> 00:26:42.250
- [Gary] Too weird?

00:26:42.250 --> 00:26:44.090
- I actually kind of
wanted to play basketball.

00:26:44.090 --> 00:26:45.940
But I don't know, just the whole like.

00:26:45.940 --> 00:26:47.681
- Has anybody in the
league ever come up to you

00:26:47.681 --> 00:26:48.514
and been like, "yo,
have a good game today.

00:26:48.514 --> 00:26:49.347
"I got you on my fantasy team."

00:26:49.347 --> 00:26:50.180
- Some people yeah.

00:26:50.180 --> 00:26:53.020
- That's crazy, I love that shit.

00:26:53.020 --> 00:26:54.760
- I think that helped out a lot.

00:26:54.760 --> 00:26:56.049
- The whole sports card thing that I've

00:26:56.049 --> 00:26:56.882
been telling you about,

00:26:56.882 --> 00:26:57.715
I've been thinking about it.

00:26:57.715 --> 00:26:59.380
I'm like, man, in 24 months,

00:26:59.380 --> 00:27:01.160
'cause basketball cards
are going through the roof.

00:27:01.160 --> 00:27:02.710
Some of these guys are
gonna like make jokes,

00:27:02.710 --> 00:27:04.080
