00:27:04.080 --> 00:27:05.966
I bought 100 of your rookies last night.

00:27:05.966 --> 00:27:07.494
- I could believe it.

00:27:07.494 --> 00:27:08.404
- [Gary] 100%, 100%.

00:27:08.404 --> 00:27:09.237
- I could believe it.

00:27:09.237 --> 00:27:10.290
You know, now with the
gambling and things like that,

00:27:10.290 --> 00:27:14.330
you know, everybody, the whole
fantasy thing is going crazy.

00:27:14.330 --> 00:27:15.520
I probably say.

00:27:15.520 --> 00:27:16.620
- Fans are yelling at you.

00:27:16.620 --> 00:27:19.298
- 80% of people who I ever encounter.

00:27:19.298 --> 00:27:20.508
- [Gary] Bring that up.

00:27:20.508 --> 00:27:21.430
- Yeah bring fantasy up.

00:27:21.430 --> 00:27:22.890
- Yeah, you're on the road.

00:27:22.890 --> 00:27:25.330
You think it's a hostile
environment in Minnesota,

00:27:25.330 --> 00:27:27.737
