00:27:32.400 --> 00:27:34.640
I get crazy on that shit as a real fan.

00:27:34.640 --> 00:27:38.360
Like, when my crew of Jet
fans, like quietly claps.

00:27:38.360 --> 00:27:40.528
I'll never forget this,
my bro, Alex Cline,

00:27:40.528 --> 00:27:43.680
