00:27:43.680 --> 00:27:45.270
against the Jets on a Jets-Bangles game,

00:27:45.270 --> 00:27:46.920
I lost my mind.

00:27:46.920 --> 00:27:48.610
I'm like, "we're fucking Jets fans."

00:27:48.610 --> 00:27:50.497
Fuck your fantasy team, bench his ass.

00:27:50.497 --> 00:27:51.330
- [Allen] Yeah.

00:27:51.330 --> 00:27:52.163
- I don't give a shit if you know

00:27:52.163 --> 00:27:52.996
we have a soft secondary.

00:27:52.996 --> 00:27:54.370
- Yeah that's how it goes though,

00:27:54.370 --> 00:27:56.070
that's really how it goes.

00:27:56.070 --> 00:27:56.903
- Yeah man.

00:27:56.903 --> 00:27:58.850
- Everybody, you could be
on the road everywhere.

00:27:58.850 --> 00:27:59.683
