00:28:02.454 --> 00:28:03.287
Let's put another number
in, I'm getting pissed.

00:28:03.287 --> 00:28:04.680
If you're a fucking Vikings fan,

00:28:04.680 --> 00:28:06.450
you can't like Allen.

00:28:06.450 --> 00:28:07.473
It's a rule.

00:28:09.010 --> 00:28:12.480
- You know, there's some
Vikings fans that you'll see,

00:28:12.480 --> 00:28:13.730
I got you on fantasy.

00:28:13.730 --> 00:28:15.300
- Have a big game, but I hope you lose.

00:28:15.300 --> 00:28:17.714
