00:28:17.714 --> 00:28:19.456
That's the best feeling as a player,

00:28:19.456 --> 00:28:21.030
that's the best feeling as a player

00:28:21.030 --> 00:28:22.338
in a hostile environment.

00:28:22.338 --> 00:28:23.755
- [Caller] Hello?

00:28:24.754 --> 00:28:25.930
Yes?

00:28:25.930 --> 00:28:28.390
- It's Gary Vaynerchuk and Allen Robinson.

00:28:28.390 --> 00:28:30.260
- [Caller] I'm not
