00:28:37.620 --> 00:28:38.453
- [Caller] I'm from Nashville.

00:28:38.453 --> 00:28:40.546
- I get it, I know Knoxville.

00:28:40.546 --> 00:28:41.379
- [Caller] You know Knoxville, okay.

00:28:41.379 --> 00:28:42.212
